<Layout
  title="Desa Umbu Pabal - Pemerintahan & Profil"
  activePage="tentangKami"
>
  <!-- Hero Section: Village Profile -->
  <section
    class="relative h-153.5 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img
        alt="Desa Umbu Pabal Landscape"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBv5DzSDYSZ0VOEhEY_mGSUnKm-rrLSNmRcWk7Lr-kUqaYmloeL5G3-l2QKEsYizA6SW70l0smWakk9dySRxsv9RyGFGGX0nRBxYWIR4GwpAuoo8-zeO03C2Q2uf4HiXWujYpV6dgCCK4RooD8VygOME97TkNWHAEicqCC6579HmjcRajMA-z6Ry4EGZz8jeGdG-8Z3bjdIlsdmZvkclJP-W9p01zJEfdE5vDv-LDGCJvE6RSX9oVByXnwGXgGh-NYEJhWpARFWKvs"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-b from-primary/40 to-primary/80"
      >
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 text-center text-white px-gutter">
      <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl mb-4">
        Profil &amp; Pemerintahan
      </h1>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto text-primary-fixed">
        Mewujudkan Digital Stewardship: Memadukan nilai tradisional dengan tata
        kelola modern untuk kesejahteraan seluruh warga.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- History & Heritage: Asymmetric Layout -->
  <section
    class="py-section-padding-desktop px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0"
  >
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="relative">
        <div
          class="absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-24 h-24 bg-secondary-container rounded-xl -z-10"
        >
        </div>
        <img
          alt="History Image"
          class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full aspect-square object-cover"
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBjNze4nuQaRSXSXjx-N68dN27yiiEjw7IJkNL1Lil1C4N-apcwJi1axAaiwwdZbhL903Dr5gU9o5XW_oMPUGcO5MiuzA8ZPpfvcVbJehj4aWcJW02i8b07CP4-wJ0U3H43N4WwBzqrjPAcZqowvF8XZ_ZSlrj1gBILJUlzQhZEezhWl6pLgeL6ez_utYvcPz_tmROJnOL0VjrlQHkdOctt-yI-3_LhRIP_-xYLGGHVYETvT0sH-PU-UUAsKnm86Qq7iWAXVxBDlxU"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <span
          class="bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-label-md font-label-md"
          >Sejarah Desa</span
        >
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">
          Warisan Pertumbuhan &amp; Inovasi
        </h2>
        <p
          class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed"
        >
          Didirikan pada awal abad ke-19, Desa Umbu Pabal bermula sebagai
          pemukiman agraris kecil yang menjunjung tinggi semangat gotong royong.
          Selama dua dekade terakhir, kami telah bertransformasi menjadi pelopor
          desa digital tanpa meninggalkan akar budaya kami.
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed"
        >
          Melalui visi 'Digital Stewardship', kami memastikan setiap langkah
          pembangunan adalah bentuk penghormatan terhadap alam dan leluhur,
          menggunakan teknologi untuk melindungi sumber daya kita bagi generasi
          mendatang.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-8 py-4 border-t border-outline-variant">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-primary font-headline-md text-2xl font-bold"
              >1824</span
            >
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md"
              >Tahun Berdiri</span
            >
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-primary font-headline-md text-2xl font-bold"
              >12K+</span
            >
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md">Populasi</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-primary font-headline-md text-2xl font-bold"
              >85%</span
            >
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md"
              >Ruang Hijau</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Organizational Chart: Perangkat Desa -->
  <section
    class="py-section-padding-desktop px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto border-t border-outline-variant/30 transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0"
  >
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">
        Struktur Organisasi
      </h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md mt-4">
        Kepemimpinan yang berdedikasi melayani kepentingan warga.
      </p>
    </div>
    <!-- Chart Layout -->
    <div class="space-y-16">
      <!-- Head -->
      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <div class="group relative w-full max-w-sm">
          <div
            class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-lg transition-all text-center p-6"
          >
            <div
              class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-4 border-primary-fixed"
            >
              <img
                alt="Kepala Desa"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuACbovTfhJi7W1B9bKN3_mAgHlK-MY48ucCTDUfEBS8mGMUNQ13-h_boGePdDiAxdESklPVnK_9NFQB5pOL18J_dDHtDN3CFTlzqkoLxWGtC5_3GGqdNr6ZWJK9-0Zy7yDkJVapo1fR3i19EfSZ4FKhZkf4BeMp5kfAXfmzpIYX3RvKtRQ3N2g0YC7gEkN_yrY6Y6d1W-Y5jM5ZFocT7-1CHLaa6X1Eh0WjRwIYHeCx3DTGheq-6c_JAMcy9sCyEt9vn5WeLVYhsD4"
              />
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">
              Bpk. Ahmad Subarjo
            </h3>
            <span
              class="text-secondary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block mt-1"
              >Kepala Desa</span
            >
            <div class="mt-4 flex justify-center gap-3">
              <span
                class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary cursor-pointer"
                >mail</span
              >
              <span
                class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary cursor-pointer"
                >link</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Second Row -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Member 1 -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-center shadow-sm"
        >
          <div
            class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-primary-fixed"
          >
            <img
              alt="Sekretaris Desa"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAPVZxfo__g2AocL3F4cKoC26EpbObA1J2qndoPwmE3yajDcFxzuixOF4KDwUHUPGzFYL-mvJTV7P6nvEh3bDpRXfc9adyCyWxvzH3bzyEEPvd-kINpkujqtxRWJMLtSZNL8EXDXNJlTbR6OdHULG9qcnrEUdJZOMbvjNQ_UzF9NH1i8zt9N2CVG9SIUEdcSCFo-eEp1KKqUyVlQZ0UU66TNT6TusX3XSb8L1BnZ6W17FVPkGs9oPzGnQ2OjEJt4M5KdlPqFtIbeVM"
            />
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">
            Ibu Siti Aminah
          </h4>
          <span
            class="text-secondary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block"
            >Sekretaris Desa</span
          >
        </div>
        <!-- Member 2 -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-center shadow-sm"
        >
          <div
            class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-primary-fixed"
          >
            <img
              alt="Bendahara Desa"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAp5IMvd35GIP0jCDWp0Ia9puHS7T9Po4W2d7233eZtEorZe6khWrPQUUIcJy6nFR3E2ps2z_6-55taJWuidCut6Cnc5KMyP-MRWXKIC86UkZ4-YW9oIomUMrN8vDJqx6tzo5Y5gSPC8bYkWp_ptRf9KLLDozukeQX3w2T2wshHKLjHDgt9EdIzBIEkw51KCbSNpQA2RPntXsfpnYSX7BzPu8PUmd9NGeaA1Hbq-5kWxEt-9TW2x4JTMDzMuDh_CozgiyeJhrmZvsY"
            />
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">
            Bpk. Hendra Wijaya
          </h4>
          <span
            class="text-secondary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block"
            >Bendahara Desa</span
          >
        </div>
        <!-- Member 3 -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-center shadow-sm"
        >
          <div
            class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-primary-fixed"
          >
            <img
              alt="Kaur Pembangunan"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCEq9Phij20MvrytHEkAmxv-R4b2A8PNukOlmQw5gWKs7bFx1DGmR6Xr7Op1n3uPMkYSa5-iUpDJmlgC79QFp3HKvPSN671ybV7ogKWGKxub_3w-PNMsHpwVUeSD3qeGt_lmBhREECxhvgQ0YthGgj9TOSPf8Cugdwk4jmZOdPd-lNi3muECkausPETS6yXunESlDVlvv__fUY6fhBWSwV3IkvtvPJ-fLMjVb36rN-JO87hEG35tvFYkaNWDGvaQZApgLeu1tLFfMo"
            />
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">
            Ibu Maya Lestari
          </h4>
          <span
            class="text-secondary font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider block"
            >Kaur Pembangunan</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Wilayah Desa Section -->
  <section
    class="bg-surface-container-low py-section-padding-desktop transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0"
  >
    <div class="px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">
          Wilayah Desa
        </h2>
        <p
          class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
        >
          Terletak di lembah yang subur, wilayah Desa Umbu Pabal mencakup area
          perbukitan hijau, lahan pertanian produktif, dan kawasan lindung yang
          terpelihara dengan baik.
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- Map and Stats Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start">
        <!-- Map Area -->
        <div
          class="lg:col-span-2 bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm h-100 md:h-125 relative"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <iframe
              allowfullscreen=""
              class="w-full h-full border-0 grayscale opacity-80"
              loading="lazy"
              referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
              src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3963.0!2d107.0!3d-6.8!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x0!2zNsKwNDgnMDAuMCJTIDEwN8KwMDAnMDAuMCJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sid!4v1634567890123!5m2!1sen!2sid"
            ></iframe>
            <div
              class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur px-4 py-2 rounded shadow-md pointer-events-none"
            >
              <span
                class="text-label-md text-primary flex items-center gap-2 font-bold"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm"
                  >location_on</span
                >
                Lokasi Kantor Desa Desa Umbu Pabal
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Statistics Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
          <div
            class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div
                class="bg-primary-container p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">landscape</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-1">
                  Luas Wilayah Total
                </h4>
                <p class="font-headline-md text-primary font-bold text-xl">
                  1.250 Ha
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div
                class="bg-secondary-container p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-on-secondary-container"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">north</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-1">
                  Batas Utara
                </h4>
                <p class="font-headline-md text-primary font-bold text-xl">
                  Hutan Lindung Gunung Hijau
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div
                class="bg-secondary-container p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-on-secondary-container"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">south</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-1">
                  Batas Selatan
                </h4>
                <p class="font-headline-md text-primary font-bold text-xl">
                  Sungai Jernih &amp; Desa Makmur
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div
                class="bg-secondary-container p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-on-secondary-container"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">altitude</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-1">
                  Ketinggian Rata-rata
                </h4>
                <p class="font-headline-md text-primary font-bold text-xl">
                  450 - 600 mdpl
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section
    class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container py-section-padding-desktop transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0"
  >
    <div class="px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">
        Ingin Berpartisipasi dalam Pembangunan?
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto opacity-90">
        Kami selalu membuka pintu bagi ide, kolaborasi, dan kontribusi dari
        seluruh warga untuk mewujudkan Desa Umbu Pabal yang lebih baik.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/layanan"
          class="bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-label-md hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity text-center font-bold"
        >
          Ajukan Usulan Digital
        </a>
        <a
          href="/event"
          class="border border-on-primary-container px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-label-md hover:bg-on-primary-container hover:text-primary-container transition-all text-center"
        >
          Lihat Jadwal Musyawarah
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    // Fade-in animation on scroll using IntersectionObserver
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
      const observerOptions = {
        threshold: 0.1,
      };

      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            entry.target.classList.add("opacity-100", "translate-y-0");
            entry.target.classList.remove("opacity-0", "translate-y-10");
          }
        });
      }, observerOptions);

      document.querySelectorAll("section").forEach((section) => {
        section.classList.add(
          "transition-all",
          "duration-700",
          "opacity-0",
          "translate-y-10",
        );
        observer.observe(section);
      });
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
